":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist. A boy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very kind and friendly person, but somewhat fearful and has low self-esteem. Pretty weak-willed, and will rely fully on someone else if they let him. After his older sister's death drove their mother to insanity, he took on her role, becoming \"Natsuki\" so as to not break his mother's heart. Was enrolled in Momoyuri Academy a few months later."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42076"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/33c1ad53ae7bce93e6eef5bc0cd04e29f24887342ada5056750d0cb15f297141.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42fe8f5c95c62bc56224c01e3b5fadf6b3a1e65d11e1c4973c63886f55611b25.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"まき いづみ","creatorId":"vndb:s365","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s365","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s365","name":"やなせ なつみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:32088","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42077","characterName":"神倉 紗耶香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42077"},"originalCharacterName":"神倉 紗耶香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Onee-sama. Ojou-sama. Upperclassman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her scholastic and athletic abilities are unparalleled, she's an almost impeccably perfect young lady with a strong sense of self-discipline. Sayaka is a natural-born leader, but her flawless countenance makes her seem unapproachable. Her nickname amongst her peers is \"Sayaka-gozen.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her grandfather is the top of the Kamikura zaibatsu, and her mother is the successor. Her father is the principal of Momoyuri Academy. Her strong sense of responsibility also helps her in caring for Nagisa."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42077"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da533eae0e4fe8cda44dfe6ea5ec9301cc427f7f8bd7e8be9fbf97767dd410fe.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/5817291308b946ca1ae52278268750591572c4b08fc9f3c018fedf4693e63ac2.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"海原 エレナ","creatorId":"vndb:s125","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s125","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s125","name":"横手 久美子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:32087","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42078","characterName":"関屋 光琉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42078"},"originalCharacterName":"関屋 光琉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An \"Onii-sama-like Onee-sama.\" Upperclassman."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An athletic and helpful girl, and Sayaka's roommate/best friend. Hikaru and Sayaka are considered the school's \"best couple\" according to the other students. The underclassmen call Hikaru the \"Prince of Light.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a somewhat cynical disposition that's gotten her into trouble with the teachers. Although she was sickly in her childhood, her mother's devoted care and education made her grow up strong. Her father left their family when she was very young, and her mother died recently as well. Sayaka's father heard of this and took pity on her, enrolling her in Momoyuri Academy to help her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42078"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/9726a0cf5e82b453dcc2c78f4830f138a4714428a732aaf0bb89122a6e98438d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/889b003365aed6ca84130fb63b18b16de0c1f446ae0e5f1a1f4b590c3ae74754.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水 香","creatorId":"vndb:s1239","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1239","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1239","name":"浅野 るり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:32091","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42079","characterName":"久慈川 カレン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42079"},"originalCharacterName":"久慈川 カレン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Roommate. Natsuki's age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The bright and cheerful mood-maker. Although her appearance is distinctly foreign, she was born and raised in Japan and is fluent and accustomed to the language and culture. Sometimes jokes around by pretending to be an ignorant tourist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She greatly enjoys physical contact, and often clings to Natsuki. She also has a pet flying squirrel named Suu-san."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42079"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9ed58e3cdbe7935970ca61d7748ba24c217a523977a1bc9ce017437b12cf4d5b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f4703a7a4d73ad897eeb189bbf9f0827e49a2ca7ee4f52b86731c008532c7f8d.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"秋月 まい","creatorId":"vndb:s657","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s657","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s657","name":"谷井 あすか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:32090","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42081","characterName":"二ノ宮 凛","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42081"},"originalCharacterName":"二ノ宮 凛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Underclassman. Part of a set of twins-- to tell them apart, Rin has long hair, and Ran has short hair."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Very mischievous and capricious. Friendly-seeming at first glance, but it's hard to tell what either of them are actually thinking. They're also Sayaka's maternal cousins."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42081"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/727a49433026623261b1929f72991d1b6c955658d1e1457e436275baa3afde59.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c3d550853d650e8714feaf5fc558e775e3db03c2916be7cf57d4783918758a15.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榊 るな","creatorId":"vndb:s654","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s654","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s654","name":"小暮 英麻","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:32089","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42083","characterName":"二ノ宮 蘭","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42083"},"or